Just start and go afk



Features:
It auto merges, auto upgrade, auto prestige, and upgrade bricks.


Requirements:
Use it with 10x barrel speed buff

Tested
Bluestacks
LDPlayer
NoxPlayer(Best performance)





Totally customizable and easy to use
